Notebook[{Cell[
"\<This notebook, contains the calculations related to the Schr\[ODoubleDot]dinger operators. The outline is as follows. After some general definitions, we provide the calculation used to study the long angular momenta without eigenvalues. After this, follow the computations that are used to prove that the the odd (2,0) and the even (1,0) component have only 1 negative eigenvalue.  
\>",
