"\<We compute the determinants of the minors, to invoke Sylvester\[CloseCurlyQuote]s criterion. For this the positive prefactor r^2( a r^2+b)^2 ( a r^2 +b+2)^2 in the definition of M11odd helps, as it turns all determinants into polynomials with non-negative coefficients. \[LineSeparator]\>",
